# Module 01: Clock Generator & Timing Unit

The primary timing and synchronization engine for the 8-bit breadboard CPU. This module provides glitch-free clock pulses (`CLK` and `~CLK`) and orchestrates execution flow across all system registers.

![Clock Module Demo](media/manual-pulse-demo.gif)

## Functional Overview

The clock module acts as the "heartbeat" of the Von Neumann architecture. To support both high-speed automated instruction execution and precise low-level hardware debugging, the module implements **three distinct operational modes** selectable via an onboard hardware switch.

